---
import SeasonBadge from "../components/SeasonBadge.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="2026-2027 Current Race" description="The current live National Points Race for the 2026-2027 season.">
  <header class="shell hero">
    <SeasonBadge classification="Current live race" />
    <p class="eyebrow season-line">2026-2027</p>
    <h1>The current NPR.</h1>
    <p class="dek">The season is initialized with all 20 frozen tournament lineages. The first standings will appear after eligible final results are published and verified.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell stats-grid">
      <div class="stat"><span>Current status</span><strong>Initialized</strong></div>
      <div class="stat"><span>Tracked lineages</span><strong>20</strong></div>
      <div class="stat"><span>Scored events</span><strong>0</strong></div>
      <div class="stat"><span>Policy</span><strong class="policy">legacy-2024-25-v1</strong></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell notice">
      <h2>Why there are no standings yet</h2>
      <p>It is August 2026. The race will not invent preseason scores. Published standings begin when a tracked tournament has eligible final evidence.</p>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/2026-27/tournaments/">View tournament audit</a><a class="button secondary" href="/methodology/">Read the scoring rules</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .season-line { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .policy { font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.4vw, 1.6rem); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
</style>
